{"type":"click","text":"B: Sectioned Dashboard (Recommended)\n      \n        Organize into collapsible sections:\n        • Section 1 — Pulse: Live ticker + today's mini KPIs (revenue, spend, margin, orders)\n        • Section 2 — Period View: Date picker + Summary cards + Waterfall + Margin\n        • Section 3 — Trends: Net profit trend + Daily breakdown (existing)\n        • Section 4 — Hourly: Heatmap (new)\n        • Section 5 — Products: Product performance table with real COGS/digital logic\n        • Section 6 — Chargebacks: Lost/Recovered tracker\n        • Section 7 — Settings: COGS Manager + Breakdown tabs\n        UI style: 2062 — monochrome surfaces, 1px borders, large typography for numbers, micro-labels, no color unless it encodes data (green=profit, red=loss). Glass-morphism subtle blur on section headers.\n      \n      \n        ProsOrganized, scannableFuture-proof structureCollapsible = less scrollClean visual hierarchy\n        ConsMore code to writeSlightly more complex state","choice":"approach-b","id":null,"timestamp":1773387668215}
